      "claim_summary": "Use and disuse dynamics unify memory recall with continuous learning and capability expansion.",
      "missing": false,
      "grounding_status": "Partial",
      "claim_text_verbatim": "This natural dynamic of use and disuse unifies the recovery of past experience with learning that deepens what the agent knows, refines how it acts, and expands what it can accomplish.",
      "evidence_spans": [
        {
